[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.08]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.16]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.14]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.66]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:25.80]One note at a time
[00:30.68]from people passing through
[00:35.72]a name beside a line
[00:40.72]and part of it is you
[00:47.08]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
